# Decision and feature log

Before implementing a feature or changing product behavior:

1. Read [`docs/log/INDEX.md`](docs/log/INDEX.md) and any related files under [`docs/log/`](docs/log/).
2. If the work touches stack, tenancy, money, LLM, sync, or imports vs expenses ownership, also read [`docs/DECISIONS.md`](docs/DECISIONS.md).

After the work is done in the same session:

1. Add `docs/log/YYYY-MM-DD-short-slug.md` using the template in [`docs/log/README.md`](docs/log/README.md).
2. Prepend a line on [`docs/log/INDEX.md`](docs/log/INDEX.md).
3. Do this without waiting for the user to ask.

Do not silently contradict a locked ADR in `DECISIONS.md`. If the user overrides one, log it as a **decision** and name the ADR to revisit.

Keep entries short and factual. Never put secrets (API keys, `.env`) in the log.
